            "commit_sha": "0dceb9a02e74ea32448a9894e7a34a71dbc7c328",
            "commit_message": "feat: Add text similarity detection and visualization features\n\n- Implemented text similarity checking using TF-IDF and cosine similarity in the PDF analysis workflow.\n- Enhanced PDF metadata storage to include full text for similarity comparisons.\n- Created a new route and template for visualizing global data, including top contributors and document authors.\n- Added loading spinner for better user experience during data processing.\n- Improved search functionality in the data master view with automatic submission.\n- Introduced delete confirmation modals for both PDF documents and Git repositories.\n- Updated various templates to reflect new features and improve layout consistency.",
